    "text": "By Andy Thurston, Augustana Athletics Communications ,\n1 days ago SIOUX FALLS, S.D. - Augustana head men's basketball coach Cody Schilling has announced the addition of four transfers. Evan Anderson, JJ Ferrin, Jacob Martin and Isaac Nyakundi have signed to play for the Vikings in the 2026-27 season. \"We are extremely excited about this group of guys,\" said Schilling. \"To... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
